.TH dccapl-linux 1 "August 2025" "dbc-dxfs-dccapp-runner 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dccapl-linux \- launch DB/C DX programs from a .dccapp file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dccapl-linux
.I file.dccapp
[
.B --dxrun
.I /path/to/dxrun
] [
.B --mount-root
.I /mnt/wws
]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B dccapl-linux
parses a Windows-origin .dccapp launcher, loads environment from the referenced INI, and invokes the DB/C DX runtime.
All sensitive data (hosts, ports, credentials) must be supplied by the .dccapp at runtime.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --dxrun PATH
Path to DB/C DX runtime binary (default: dxrun on PATH).
.TP
.B --mount-root DIR
Linux mount root to map UNC paths (default: /mnt/wws).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR xdg-open (1)
